479	          </div>
480	          <div>
481	            <p className="text-[13px] font-semibold text-white">One job at a time</p>
482	            <p className="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-tx-dim">
483	              The platform runs one job per server, so a certificate queued behind a rebuild or resize
484	              waits its turn — the queue status on a pending row shows exactly what it's behind.
485	            </p>
486	          </div>
487	          <div>
488	            <p className="text-[13px] font-semibold text-white">Weekly issuance limit</p>
489	            <p className="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-tx-dim">
